": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/947552750", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/806#issuecomment-947552750", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/806", "id": 947552750, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s44eoHu", "user": {"login": "ArtBor86", "id": 92856492, "node_id": "U_kgDOBYjgrA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92856492?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86", "html_url": "https://github.com/ArtBor86", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArtBor86/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-10-20T10:54:59Z", "updated_at": "2021-10-20T10:54:59Z", "body": "Hi, \r\nI try to use VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE with PX4 (EKF2), but have some problem.\r\n\r\n**Result of this code:**\r\n`int main(int argc, char** argv)`\r\n`{`\r\n   ` Mavsdk mavsdk;`\r\n   ` ConnectionResult connection_result = mavsdk.add_any_connection(\"serial:///dev/ttyACM0\");`\r\n\r\n    if (connection_result != ConnectionResult::Success) {\r\n        std::cerr << \"Connection failed: \" << connection_result << '\\n';\r\n        return 1;\r\n    }\r\n    auto system = get_system(mavsdk);\r\n    if (!system) {\r\n        return 1;\r\n    }\r\n    // Instantiate pluginis.\r\n    auto telemetry = Telemetry{system};\r\n    auto action = Action{system};\r\n    auto mocap = Mocap{system};\r\n    mavsdk::Mocap::VisionPositionEstimate VPE;\r\n    VPE.time_usec=0;\r\n    VPE.position_body.x_m=1.0f;\r\n    VPE.position_body.y_m=1.0f;\r\n    VPE.position_body.z_m=1.0f;\r\n    VPE.angle_body.pitch_rad = 0.0f;\r\n    VPE.angle_body.roll_rad = 0.0f;\r\n    VPE.angle_body.yaw_rad = 0.0f;\r\n\r\n    const auto set_VPE_result = mocap.set_vision_position_estimate(VPE);\r\n    std::cout << \"VPE: \" << set_VPE_result << \"\\n\";\r\n\r\n**is:**\r\n\r\n[12:40:58|Info ] MAVSDK version: v0.44.0 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:29)\r\nWaiting to discover system...\r\n[12:40:58|Debug] New: System ID: 1 Comp ID: 1 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:475)\r\n[12:40:58|Debug] Component Autopilot (1) added. (system_impl.cpp:372)\r\n[12:40:58|Debug] Discovered 1 component(s) (system_impl.cpp:520)\r\nDiscovered autopilot\r\n**_VPE: Invalid Request Data_**\r\n\r\n\u0421an someone suggest the reason for the \"Invalid Request Data\" or provide a working code example (C++) with SET_VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE?\r\n\r\nThanks for the impressive work!\r\n\r\nArtem.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/947552750/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/947867922", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/806#issuecomment-947867922", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/806", "id": 947867922, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s44f1ES", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes